OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet and windy start in the
OL,6,Feast before drier conditions with
OL,7,Flighter winds gradually spread across
OL,8,Ffrom the west, perhaps the odd bright
OL,9,Fspell in the west by the end of the
OL,10,Fday.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain continuing in the east
OL,13,Fand south, dry with some clear spells
OL,14,Ffurther west, perhaps some frost here
OL,15,Ftoo, light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FCloudy with some patchy
OL,18,Frain in the east, drier in the west,
OL,19,Fpossibly some brighter spells too.
OL,20,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
